---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site.config.mjs";
---
<Page title="About Universianity" description="Who we are and how our guides are made.">
  <p>
    <strong>{SITE.name}</strong> blends <em>university</em> and <em>humanity</em>: practical, honest guidance for anyone
    trying to get into, pay for, survive and make the most of higher education.
  </p>
  <h2>What we publish</h2>
  <p>
    A new guide every day across admissions, scholarships, study skills, careers, study abroad, AI tools and student
    life — plus a curated <a href="/resources/">resource library</a> of official websites.
  </p>
  <h2>How our guides are made</h2>
  <p>
    Our articles are researched from official and reputable sources and drafted with the help of AI. Every guide
    links to its sources so you can verify the details. Deadlines, fees and rules change often — always confirm on
    the official website before you act.
  </p>
  <p>Spotted a mistake? <a href="/contact/">Tell us</a> and we will fix it.</p>
</Page>
